+		},
+		step = 3,
+		sink = 0.35,
+	},
+}
+-- A map's ends (A012 steps 3–4). The arrival is the moonwell itself: the ring
+-- of standing stones round a pool of cold silver-teal light, the landmark a
+-- player sees and walks to; its lantern is one of the priestesses' last. The
+-- way on is a pale arch whose sheet burns the same cold colour once cleared.
